  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmattias150784.github.io%252frequestcommission.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><code>想要一個客製化模組？</code></strong></a></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>HTTYD 畫作模組新增了來自《馴龍高手》系列及電影中的各種龍類畫作</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>本模組包含的龍類範例如下：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>-夜煞</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>-致命納德</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>-葛倫科</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>-恐怖龍</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>-迷惑巨獸</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>-恐怖龍（小型）</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>-紅色死神</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>還有更多！</strong></span></p>",
